From 67667d44bf3f6b02dcc9621fcac4e7d92d26beea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ming Lu <ming.lu@citrix.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:20:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] CA-430075: Symlink/directory creation traversal via PUT
 /messages body

Add sanity check against the ref, object_uuid and uuid in the message
XML body in PUT requests. These fields will be used to create symlinks
on dom0's filesystem.

Includes a unit test for the sanity check of the message body.

This is CVE-2026-102708, part of XSA-530.

Signed-off-by: Ming Lu <ming.lu@citrix.com>
Reviewed-by: Andrii Sultanov <andriy.sultanov@vates.tech>
